    "category": "Water meter",
    "type_designations": ["Unico4", "Unico4coder MP", "Unico4e"],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Single-jet impeller water meters for cold and hot water, designed according to the dry-register principle, with brass body and connecting screw threads. Water flows through a mechanical strainer, single-jet onto the impeller wheel; the flow-proportional rotary motion of the impeller is transmitted to the counter by a magnetic coupling; a sealing plate secured with a bayonet ring is located between impeller and totalizer. Unico4/Unico4coder MP water meters have a mechanical pointer roller counter with 5 rollers and reed contact (Unico4) or pointer roller counter with 8 rollers and absolute encoder (Unico4coder MP). Unico4e water meters have an electronic counter that senses the magnetic coupling of the hydraulics by means of TMR (resistive magnet) sensors; the firmware is split and runs on two microcontrollers, the metrology and display being the legally relevant part, while wM-Bus/LoRaWAN/NFC communication is not legally relevant. Adjustment by turning the sealing plate (Unico4e also electronically by changing the pulse value). Installation in four positions: horizontal with indicating device at top, horizontal with indicating device at side, vertical flow bottom-to-top with indicating device at side, vertical flow top-to-bottom with indicating device at side. The mechanical counter (Unico4coder MP) is available with composite housing IP67 or copper housing IP68 (manufacturer information, not certified)."
